      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm working on a standard operating procedure for our international mRNA vaccine distribution. We need a comprehensive checklist for maintaining the cold chain during cross-border transit. Can you outline the key requirements for temperature monitoring, packaging specifications, and contingency protocols to prevent spoilage?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
